                    f"RSI max: {CFG.SCANNER_RSI_MAX} (период {CFG.SCANNER_RSI_PERIOD})\n"
                    f"Анти-памп 2H (abs): {CFG.SCANNER_PUMP_MIN_PCT}%–{CFG.SCANNER_PUMP_MAX_PCT}%\n"
